<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Travelers/Aetna estimate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Travelers/Aetna estimate.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter analyst Michael Lewis said he raised Travelers/Aetna Property Casualty Corp's 1997 earnings estimate to $2.75 a share from $2.60.</p>
<p>-- Said 1997 estimate does not include any possible share repurchases or acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Set tentative 1998 estimate of $3.10 a share. Estimate includes some share repurchase but no acquisition.</p>
<p>-- Raised price target to $45 from $37. Target assumes accretive acquisition made and consummated in next 12 months.</p>
</text>
